---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Signage FAQs | Manchester Sign Group" description="Find answers about sign types, illuminated signage, installation, artwork, sizes, estimates and ordering from Manchester Sign Group.">
  <main class="inner-page">
    <div class="page-head"><small>COMMON QUESTIONS</small><h1>FREQUENTLY <em>ASKED</em></h1><p>Quick answers about our signs, estimates and services.</p></div>
    <section class="faq">
      <details><summary>How does the instant estimate work?</summary><p>Enter the sign type and approximate width and height. The calculator gives an estimated starting price. Final pricing can depend on the exact specification and installation requirements.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you install signs?</summary><p>Installation is available for suitable projects. Select installation in the estimator or mention it when requesting a quote.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can you design my sign?</summary><p>Yes. Tell us what you need and provide your branding or artwork where available.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Can I supply my own artwork?</summary><p>Yes. Send your artwork with your enquiry and we can discuss the required format and production details.</p></details>
      <details><summary>What sizes can you make?</summary><p>We can discuss the required size for your project. Use the estimator for an initial guide or request a quote for a specific size.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you make illuminated signs?</summary><p>Yes. Our services include illuminated 3D, RGB 3D and neon signage.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you deliver throughout the UK?</summary><p>Yes. Manchester Sign Group is based in Manchester and offers delivery throughout the United Kingdom.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do your products include a warranty?</summary><p>Yes. All products include a one-year warranty.</p></details>
      <details><summary>Do you supply sign-making materials?</summary><p>Yes. Visit the Shop section for sign-making supplies and lighting products. Products are available for delivery throughout the UK and include a one-year warranty.</p></details>
      <details><summary>How do I order?</summary><p>Use the Order Now button, WhatsApp us, or send a quote request through the website.</p></details>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
<style>
.inner-page{width:min(900px,92%);margin:auto;padding:70px 0 90px}.page-head{margin-bottom:32px}.page-head small{color:#ff1730;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:3px}.page-head h1{margin:10px 0 14px;font-size:clamp(42px,7vw,70px);line-height:.95;letter-spacing:-3px}.page-head h1 em{font-style:normal;color:#ff1730}.page-head p{color:#aaa}.faq{display:grid;gap:10px}.faq details{border:1px solid #303437;border-radius:10px;background:#0c0f11;padding:0 18px}.faq summary{cursor:pointer;padding:19px 2px;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;list-style:none}.faq summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.faq summary:after{content:'+';float:right;color:#ff1730;font-size:20px}.faq details[open] summary:after{content:'−'}.faq p{margin:0;padding:0 2px 20px;color:#888;line-height:1.6;font-size:13px}
</style>